{"id":"torrey:masters","source":"torrey","name":"Masters","slug":"masters","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Authority of, established — Col 3:22; 1Pe 2:18.","refs":[["Col",3,22,3,22],["1Pet",2,18,2,18]]},{"text":"Worship God. — Ge 35:3.","refs":[["Gen",35,3,35,3]]},{"text":"Fear God. — Ac 10:2.","refs":[["Acts",10,2,10,2]]},{"text":"Serve God. — Jos 24:15.","refs":[["Josh",24,15,24,15]]},{"text":"Observe the Sabbath. — Ex 20:10; De 5:12-14.","refs":[["Exod",20,10,20,10],["Deut",5,12,5,14]]},{"text":"Put away idols. — Ge 35:2.","refs":[["Gen",35,2,35,2]]},{"text":"Should select faithful servants — Ge 24:2; Ps 101:6,7.","refs":[["Gen",24,2,24,2],["Ps",101,6,101,6],["Ps",101,7,101,7]]},{"text":"Should receive faithful advice from servants — 2Ki 5:13,14.","refs":[["2Kgs",5,13,5,13],["2Kgs",5,14,5,14]]},{"text":"To act justly. — Job 31:13,15; Col 4:1.","refs":[["Job",31,13,31,13],["Job",31,15,31,15],["Col",4,1,4,1]]},{"text":"To deal with them in the fear of God. — Eph 6:9; Col 4:1.","refs":[["Eph",6,9,6,9],["Col",4,1,4,1]]},{"text":"To esteem them highly, if saints. — Phm 1:16.","refs":[["Phlm",1,16,1,16]]},{"text":"To take care of them in sickness. — Lu 7:3.","refs":[["Luke",7,3,7,3]]},{"text":"To forbear threatening them. — Eph 6:9.","refs":[["Eph",6,9,6,9]]},{"text":"Not to defraud them. — Ge 31:7.","refs":[["Gen",31,7,31,7]]},{"text":"Not to keep back their wages. — Le 19:13; De 24:15.","refs":[["Lev",19,13,19,13],["Deut",24,15,24,15]]},{"text":"Not to rule over them with rigour. — Le 25:43; De 24:14.","refs":[["Lev",25,43,25,43],["Deut",24,14,24,14]]},{"text":"Benevolent, blessed — De 15:18.","refs":[["Deut",15,18,15,18]]},{"text":"Unjust, denounced — Jer 22:13; Jas 5:4.","refs":[["Jer",22,13,22,13],["Jas",5,4,5,4]]},{"text":"Abraham. — Ge 18:19.","refs":[["Gen",18,19,18,19]]},{"text":"Jacob. — Ge 35:2.","refs":[["Gen",35,2,35,2]]},{"text":"Joshua. — Jos 24:15.","refs":[["Josh",24,15,24,15]]},{"text":"Centurion. — Lu 7:2,3.","refs":[["Luke",7,2,7,2],["Luke",7,3,7,3